      '<p class="sv-text">But look: the three lines <b style="color:var(--sv-bad)">A</b>, <b style="color:var(--sv-purple)">B</b> and <b style="color:var(--sv-good)">C</b> all split the training points perfectly. Which one should we use?</p>' +
